  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now the mobile UI only comes in light mode. This can be quite annoying when you want to use it at night. (or when you just don't like light mode in general)\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAdd a dark mode UI, similar to how other apps already have it.\n\nThe setting for it should have the following options:\n\n- System (follows system theme)\n\n- Light Mode\n\n- Dark Mode",
